  "worked_solution": "The figure consists of two layers:\n\n- The bottom layer consists of $3$ cubes.\n\n- The top layer consists of $2$ cubes.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14132963/assets/e5bdfec9c8dfc02caff73dbf93c8a5e88261f543e439888f7884ca045cd677ff.png)\n\nTherefore, the volume is $3+2=5$ cubic inches.",
